<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of June 6, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						June 6   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,021  1,786   2,446</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 48     57	68</p>
<p>CCC					    1,277  1,277   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  2,346  3,120   3,820</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,138    438     800</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				185    181     307</p>
<p>CCC					    2,108  3,108   1,915</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,431  3,727   3,022</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
